{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDExLS0yMDIwL1RoZSUyMFNub3clMjBRdWVlbiUyMDMlMjAlMjgyMDE2JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"The Snow Queen 3","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nZmUrl59UXIC1pXrviJMB3ERCnv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zfpmUM0h0KuhAJ0yz8LF7o21O06.jpg","description":"After heroically defeating both the Snow Queen and the Snow King, Gerda still cannot find peace. Her dream is to find her parents who were once taken away from them by the North Wind and finally reunite the family. Thus, Gerda and her friends embark on an exiting journey to find her parents and encounter new challenges along the way: they discover an ancient magical artifact of the trolls, the Stone of Fire and Ice. From that moment on, things don't go according to the initial plan...Will Gerda be able to tame the mighty forces of the magical elements and get her family back? The answer will be reveled in 2016. This is a story which encompasses everything you love about Wizart: kindness, bravery, friendship, mystery, love of one's family, and a happy ending, of course!","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Family","Animation","Fantasy","Comedy","Animation"],"imdbRating":"7.0","runtime":"89 min","cast":["Nikolay Bystrov","Natalya Bystrova","Filipp Lebedev","Diomid Vinogradov","Alexander Gruzdev","Olga Zubkova","Mikhail Tikhonov","Olga Shorokhova"],"director":["Aleksey Tsitsilin"],"released":"2016-12-29T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Nikolay Bystrov","character":"Kay (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zZmoR8RrwQqCrbquNlA8H7KI4WD.jpg"},{"name":"Natalya Bystrova","character":"Gerda (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mv7E4DAxoH4sBsPbkIjcJ7eXKvD.jpg"},{"name":"Filipp Lebedev","character":"Rollan (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bIPQTvfXBNZOxlbsQCiHkHJzUIY.jpg"},{"name":"Diomid Vinogradov","character":"Orm (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4VXryQlIAvps